      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can certainly draft a memo that frames the new schedules as a strategic enhancement to operational safety and compliance. We will emphasize how the staggered rotations are specifically designed to maximize mandated rest periods, ensuring every driver meets or exceeds all regulatory guidelines. The memo will present these changes not as a burden, but as a proactive measure to elevate the standard of care for every individual on the road. This approach will present a clear, defensible narrative to both the board and the drivers.",
